module mistake_caplocal .
rem expect: E-CAP-LOCAL

proc say input out cap io . output u64 . effects io .
do
  rem ko: ✘ 권한을 지역 이름에 옮겨 담았다 --- 받은 이름을 그대로 건넨다 /// en: ✘ the capability is moved into a local name --- pass the received name directly
  let k be cap io out .
  return write_out k 1 "hi\n" .
end
